    {
      "ja": "• ガンダムエースで連載中の「機動戦士ガンダム THE ORIGIN MSD ククルス・ドアンの島」に登場する黒い局地型ガンダムがHG化！",
      "en": "• The black local Gundam that appears in \"Mobile Suit Gundam THE ORIGIN MSD Cucurrus Doan Island\" currently being serialized in Gundam Ace has been made into HG!"
